      "cat-harness:section": "Bottom-up, from the bootstrap",
      "prov:value": "It is declared for a measured reason. The layering was real before it was\nwritten down, but it lived only in prose, so every consumer that needed the\norder had to already know it — and the first one that did would have hardcoded\nfour names, which is a rule true only for the instances somebody remembered."
    },
