      "cat-harness:section": "Three relations, and they are not interchangeable",
      "prov:value": "| **associated** | Content ↔ Content, any harness | `associatedHarnesses` — a harness this one knows, and where it is published; never loaded or materialized (issue #1146, skill `associate-harness`) |",
